## ServicesApi

### Get one mail order&#39;s full detail including SMTP password
## Get one mail order&#39;s full detail including SMTP password
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/{{id}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### List your provisioned mail orders (sending accounts)
## List your provisioned mail orders (sending accounts)
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
